-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-7d819ad3-4774-422a-81ba-8e6b76d0e12b\">- 12/31(화) 15:30 ~ 16:30 경​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a02da59f-a99a-4d75-80a1-e8bea25b4e02\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-9382036f-9de6-4551-9571-e33c9ca08fc3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-73336560-22b8-4f52-83d3-9d14594f17a1\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-4cc494ec-f730-4b90-a0c5-ce1760a140f4\"><b>​✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-52b64092-6306-44a6-a604-fbe6f79f0948\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-1bd68bf0-0dcc-40fd-81e9-601f9103c490\">- 아레나 전투 후, 간헐적으로 PVE 전투에서 특정 니케의 공격이 정상적으로 반영되지 않는 현상을 일부 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ddde0f4e-f72e-441f-957d-d257052a97e3\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-10b87c10-0265-43a2-9af9-5152bdedc4f4\">└ 해당 현상이 발생할 경우 게임을 종료하신 뒤 재접속하여 주시기를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-480f345f-591c-441e-b6b0-31965419a18f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-726e22bc-d4f7-47e3-b937-78fb2478a447\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-aa521f90-2a95-427c-a16c-7c82d3a5b794\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-75841675-3549-4e53-bbab-974d2f27a9e9\">[대상]</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fa776017-e0d0-4588-8fbc-bcb7067959bd\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-184d7b7b-5285-4504-b256-a8deb7b3da13\">└ 로켓 런처 무기를 사용하는 니케의 모든 공격</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ec8b18db-d6d0-4935-ac23-b8ef70c9db98\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-17fda5d9-30fc-45ef-86b9-270654af69c4\">└  네온 : 블루 오션 버스트 스킬  「풀 하이드로 샷」</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a87a174e-a0a2-487a-881c-dd88f9019774\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-926e0bd9-2622-4338-85b5-45b06d326604\">└  라피 : 레드 후드 버스트 스킬 「계승되는 힘」</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5c9a7a43-de87-4d8f-9e07-6aa1e627ab59\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-7ef7e3fa-e836-412d-85f2-e053daba71b9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-39fd4dfe-fd78-4082-abec-a009f84adadb\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-ad568d7e-2d85-4fc8-9fc2-905e9ed827f5\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4a2ae64a-df3f-4795-b3e4-5e46c439103b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-fe91e746-7ffe-485f-a83c-8bec55d42e01\">·····················································································​<